      "source_id": "g0001-unreachable-parser-branch",
      "origin": "review-1",
      "kind": "check",
      "change_ids": [
        "g0001"
      ],
      "requirement": "After copying a successfully parsed event, the target must continue parsing so a flow-sequence mapping key can reach the added end-token branch.",
      "target_route": "The entry passes YAML bytes after two control bytes to yaml_parser_parse. A flow sequence with an empty explicit key would pass through the mapping-key state to the added branch.",
      "failure_condition": "The first successful parse produces a stream-start event. Its copy initializer returns 1, and the harness treats that success as a reason to jump to cleanup before another parse call.",
      "alternative_paths": "The complete entry has no other parse call before that exit and no other route to the changed branch.",
      "discovery_necessary": true,
      "discovery_established": true
    }
  ],
